## [SPEC-FIXTURE]
## Category: Valid
## Feature: Exhaustive Pattern Matching on Enums and Bool
## Spec Reference: docs/language-spec/type-system.md
## Expected Behavior: Exhaustive matches over tuple, struct, unit enum variants and bool pass with compatible arm types.

enum Event:
    Quit
    KeyPress(i32)
    Move:
        dx: i32
        dy: i32

fn handle_event(ev: Event) -> i32:
    return match ev:
        Event::Quit => 0
        Event::KeyPress(code) => code
        Event::Move { dx, dy } => dx + dy

fn bool_to_int(b: bool) -> i32:
    return match b:
        true => 1
        false => 0
